Notebook[{Cell["ShowIDs", "ObjectName"], Cell["ShowIDs is an option of \
CharacterTableView, RepresentationTable and GroupSummary: True adds the irrep \
ID column (default False; irreps are shown by index and labels).", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["Option of CharacterTableView, \
RepresentationTable and GroupSummary. Default: False. True adds the irrep ID \
